# Family Quest Companion - Environment Variables
# This file shows what environment variables are available for this project
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values

# Note: This project stores sensitive data (API keys) encrypted in browser localStorage
# No server-side environment variables are currently required for the application

# Example: If you add backend features in the future, you might need:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
# VITE_HABITICA_API_BASE=https://habitica.com/api/v3

# Vite exposes environment variables to the client if they are prefixed with VITE_
# Never commit .env.local or files containing real API keys to version control
